<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n63856" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Λοκρ-οί</span></b> , οἱ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>the Locrians</i>, of whom there
			were three tribes, <i>the Opuntian</i>, opposite Euboea, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				2.527
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.108
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				9.3.1
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				9.3.17
			</span></i>; <i>the Epicnemidian</i>, on Mt. Cnemis on the Maliac
			Gulf, Id.ll.cc.; and <i>the Ozolian</i>, on the Corinthian Gulf,
				<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				103
			</span></i>, etc.: <i>the Epizephyrian</i> or <u>Zephyrian</u>
			were a colony of the last on Mt. Zephyrium in lower Italy, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				10(11).13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				4.24
			</span></i> sq.,<i><span class="en">
				7.1
			</span></i>, etc.: prov. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Λοκρῶν
			σύνθημα</span>, of deceit, <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				275.43
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>:—Adj.
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Λοκρός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ά</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>,
				<u>Locrian</u>, <i><span class="en">
				Lyc.
				1429
			</span></i>:—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Λοκρικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				4.65
			</span></i>, etc.:—fem. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Λοκρίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				2.19
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ Λ.</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῆ</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Av.</u>
				152
			</span></i>, etc.</div>
